 green hoodie and navy blue half pants worn by the original surrogate to a brown suit with a blue shirt and red tie inside.\n\nHe has flab all over his body, and his stomach sticks out so much that his shirt is rolled up.\n\nHe was not able to comprehend the sudden change and had a confused look on his face with a book in one hand and a \"? He had a puzzled look on his face with a book in one hand, not understanding what had just happened.\n\nOther details are up to you!", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@One_Oneyyy/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c563bdf9/uploads/origins/6cc0d6e6-a279-459a-8ffc-a4749c4708f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9d59a73b8ea5dd5ebbebe6ff9bf9d57c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c563bdf9/uploads/origins/6cc0d6e6-a279-459a-8ffc-a4749c4708f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9d59a73b8ea5dd5ebbebe6ff9bf9d57c, https://si.imgix.net/c563bdf9/uploads/origins/6cc0d6e6-a279-459a-8ffc-a4749c4708f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=f05cb894c41c7c5135c42149763ae407 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c563bdf9/uploads/origins/6cc0d6e6-a279-459a-8ffc-a4749c4708f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e14910bef1ce3fbb7813c6530eb7558b 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1574328, "client_id": 1555620, "nc": 177}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 23311, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable